# UI styling & elements

Use existing building blocks before inventing new markup or CSS.
North star: Invoice Fly — see `design-references/` and `design-motion` rule.

## Related rules (read together)

| Rule | Covers |
|------|--------|
| `design-systems` | Operator vs client token lanes |
| `css-pattern-owners` | CSS file ownership, tokens |
| `floating-labels` | Forms, sheets, pills |
| `design-motion` | Animation archetypes, ScreenDesigns frames |
| `onboarding-experience` | Funnel, trial, paywall, activation psychology |
| `a11y-sheets` | Dialog focus trap, Escape, aria |

## Screen layout (operator)

```tsx
<div className="screen page-content body">
  <header className="page-header">…</header>
  {/* content */}
</div>
```

- Max content feel: mobile-first, ~420px column
- Bottom padding for nav: `.body` includes `90px` safe area
- Page titles: `.page-header` + `h1` / `h1.lg` — owner `app-ui.css`

## Prefer components over one-off markup

### `@/components/ui`

| Component | Use for |
|-----------|---------|
| `ListRow` | Settings rows, grouped lists, menu items |
| `SectionGroup` | iOS-style section + `.ui-list-group` card |
| `Button` | `primary` / `ghost` / `secondary` / `danger` → `.btn-*` |
| `Badge` | Status chips — `statusToBadgeTone()` |
| `EmptyState` + `EmptyIllustration` | Zero-data screens |
| `ScreenLoading` / `ScreenMessage` | Loading and error shells |
| `ActionDock` | Sticky bottom CTA bar |
| `Card` | Generic elevated surface |
| `VaulSheet` | Lightweight pickers only |
| `MonthCarousel` | Month/date carousels |

### `@/components/forms`

| Component | Use for |
|-----------|---------|
| `FloatingField` | Text inputs (operator + client) |
| `FloatingAffixField` | Money `$` fields |
| `PillGroup` | Short enums (≤9 options) |
| `SetupRowField` | Onboarding iOS settings rows |
| `BottomSheet` | Full operator forms (`variant="light"`) |
| `SheetSubmitButton` | Sheet/page save with ready/done states |

### Other shells

- `SwipeableRow` / `InvoiceSwipeableRow` — swipe actions on list rows
- `BottomNav` — operator shell nav (don't duplicate)

## Visual patterns

- **Section labels:** uppercase, ~11px, muted — via `SectionGroup` or `.ui-section__title`
- **Cards:** `.card` or `.card-pressable` — don't redefine in feature CSS
- **Icons:** `@phosphor-icons/react`, duotone, ~20–22px in lists
- **Accent:** `--green` (`#22c55e`) — never `#4caf50` / `#16a34a`
- **Press feedback:** use `.card-pressable` or component `onClick` on `ListRow`
- **Errors:** `role="alert"` + `aria-live="assertive"` on banners

## When adding new UI

1. Check `@/components/ui` and `@/components/forms` first
2. Check `docs/ui-css-audit.md` for CSS owner
3. Use correct design lane (`design-systems` rule)
4. Match Invoice Fly depth/motion when polishing (`MOTION_SPEC.md`)
5. New shared styles → extend owner file, not a new per-page CSS file

## Do not

- Raw `<input>` without `FloatingField` on operator forms
- New bottom-sheet implementations — use `BottomSheet` or `VaulSheet`
- Inline styles for colors/spacing — use tokens
- Bootstrap/MUI/shadcn — not in this project
